The gws executable that the plugin downloads from its GitHub Release, one per platform, is the unmodified Google
Workspace CLI (gws) 0.22.5 release binary for that platform, from
https://github.com/googleworkspace/cli/releases/tag/v0.22.5. It is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0;
LICENSE in this folder is the license file shipped in the same release archive. native/provenance.json records each
release archive's URL and the SHA-256 digests of the archive and the binary.

The gws CLI is not an officially supported Google product. This plugin is unofficial and is not affiliated with or
endorsed by Google.
